mission "The Kingdom Below"
    name "The Kingdom Below"
    description "Enter the drowned settlement's outer chamber and retrieve the stone record without disturbing its guardians."
    source "San Aurelio"
    destination "San Telmo"
    reward 2110
    speaker offer "Keeper Orlan"
    speaker visit "Keeper Orlan"
    speaker complete "Keeper Orlan"
    to offer
        has "A Door in the Reef: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `The outer chamber of the drowned settlement lies beyond the reef. The stone record is said to be there, but the guardians have been left undisturbed for generations.`
            `Keeper Orlan lays a cloth beside the chart. "We need the record, not a fight with whatever remains below. Enter the outer chamber, take the stone tablet, and leave the guardians where they are."`
            choice
                `"I will not leave this unanswered. Tell me where to go."`
                    accept
                `"Is this about the Company, or someone behind it?"`
                    goto details
                `"The sea is dangerous enough without old grudges. No."`
                    close
            label details
                `Orlan points to the marked entrance. "The record may explain who built the settlement and why the expedition went looking for it. Touch nothing else. We have waited too long to ruin the site through haste."`
                choice
                    `"The trail is mine to follow. I will sail now."`
                        accept
                    `"Leave me out of it. I am done here."`
                        close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Kingdom Below. Enter the drowned settlement's outer chamber and retrieve the stone record without disturbing its guardians."
    on visit
        conversation
            `At San Telmo, Orlan inspects the stone record and compares its markings with the expedition's papers. "The kingdom below was real," Orlan says. "And someone knew it long before we did."`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Orlan wraps the record in a protective cloth. "This belongs in careful keeping. Not in a palace vault, not in a merchant's counting house. The people whose waters hold this place must decide what happens next."`
        log "Completed The Kingdom Below. Received 2110 gold. Enter the drowned settlement's outer chamber and retrieve the stone record without disturbing its guardians."
